    "name": "Headless UI",
    "descriptionZh": "Tailwind Labs 出的无样式组件库，交互与无障碍行为都由库实现，视觉留给自己用 Tailwind CSS 写，React 与 Vue 各一份。",
    "takeawayZh": "拿不带样式的 React/Vue 组件原语，自己套 Tailwind 皮肤。",
    "noteZh": "整页黑底带渐变，左上角是 HeadlessUI 字标加一个 v2.1 的版本下拉，右上角只有一枚 GitHub 图标；首屏正文就是 Completely unstyled, fully accessible UI components, designed to integrate beautifully with Tailwind CSS.，往下切 React / Vue 两个标签页，铺开组件实拍的格子——第一排三格标着 Dropdown Menu、Disclosure、Dialog，Dropdown Menu 那格里展开着 Edit / Duplicate ⌘D / Archive / Delete 菜单。页脚写 © 2026 Tailwind Labs Inc. All rights reserved。",
